Package: arplsbaseline
Type: Package
Title: Baseline Correction using the arPLS Method
Version: 1.0
Date: 2025-10-22
Author: Jessica Sam
Maintainer: Jessica Sam <jessica-sam@outlook.co.nz>
Description: This package will calculate a baseline to data using  
  Asymmetrically Reweighted Penalised Least Squares Smoothing and correct data
  according to this baseline. A Spectrum object is created after using the main 
  baseline function and various methods which plot or summarise the data can be
  called on this object.
References: 
  Baek, Sung-June, Aaron Park, Young-Jin Ahn, and Jaebum Choo. 2015. 
  “Baseline Correction Using Asymmetrically Reweighted Penalized Least Squares Smoothing.” 
  The Analyst 140 (1): 250–57. https://doi.org/10.1039/c4an01061b.
